sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Operator
    participant Runner as scripts/poc
    participant CLI as Rust CLI
    participant Anki as Anki + AnkiConnect
    participant Net as Docker networks
    participant Web as AnkiWeb
    User->>CLI: create lab-outage-01
    CLI->>Anki: create and verify exactly one note
    User->>Runner: offline
    Runner->>Net: disconnect internet network only
    Runner->>CLI: ready through internal control network
    CLI->>Anki: collection checks still succeed
    User->>CLI: sync lab-outage-01
    CLI->>Anki: collection.sync -> operation handle
    Anki--xWeb: external route unavailable
    CLI->>Anki: poll original operation
    Anki-->>CLI: failed, ioError (observed in this POC)
    Note over CLI,Anki: No sync_confirmed claim and no additional addNote
    User->>Runner: online
    Runner->>Net: reconnect internet network
    User->>CLI: retry-sync lab-outage-01
    CLI->>Anki: verify same note, submit new sync attempt only
    Anki->>Web: synchronize existing note
    Web-->>Anki: synchronization succeeds
    CLI->>Anki: poll new operation -> succeeded
    Note over User,Web: Explicit phone sync and inspection complete the experiment
